{"seq":2,"slug":"network-connectivity-testing","title":"网络连通性测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/infrastructure-testing/integration-e2e/network-connectivity-testing","wordCount":996,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"网络连通性测试\">网络连通性测试</h1><p>网络是基础设施中最难调试的层——问题往往表现为&quot;连不上&quot;，但根因可能藏在安全组、路由表、NACL、DNS 解析、VPC Peering、Transit Gateway 或防火墙规则的任何一个环节。网络连通性测试的目标是将这种隐式的&quot;能通/不能通&quot;转化为显式的、可自动化验证的断言，在部署阶段而非事故发生时发现问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>连通性矩阵</strong>：用源-目标-端口-预期结果的声明式矩阵编码网络拓扑验证</li>\n<li><strong>多层验证</strong>：L3 可达性、L4 端口、L7 服务响应、DNS 解析、TLS 证书的逐层检查</li>\n<li><strong>VPC Reachability Analyzer</strong>：AWS 静态网络分析，不需运行实例即可判断可达性</li>\n<li><strong>负面测试</strong>：验证<em>不应</em>连通的路径确实被阻断——安全隔离验证</li>\n<li><strong>持续连通性监控</strong>：从部署时验证延伸到运行时持续探测</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"网络连通性的验证层次\">网络连通性的验证层次</h2><p>网络连通性不是一个单一属性，而是由多层协议栈共同决定的：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>OSI 层</th>\n<th>验证内容</th>\n<th>测试方法</th>\n<th>典型工具</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>L3 网络</td>\n<td>IP 可达性</td>\n<td>ICMP ping / traceroute</td>\n<td><code>ping</code>、VPC Reachability Analyzer</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L4 传输</td>\n<td>端口可达性</td>\n<td>TCP connect / UDP probe</td>\n<td><code>nc</code>、<code>nmap</code>、自定义探针</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L7 应用</td>\n<td>服务响应</td>\n<td>HTTP/gRPC 健康检查</td>\n<td><code>curl</code>、Terratest http_helper</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DNS</td>\n<td>名称解析</td>\n<td>A/CNAME/SRV 记录查询</td>\n<td><code>dig</code>、<code>nslookup</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TLS</td>\n<td>证书有效性</td>\n<td>TLS 握手验证</td>\n<td><code>openssl s_client</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"声明式连通性规约\">声明式连通性规约</h2><p>将期望的网络拓扑编码为可测试的规约矩阵：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"连通性矩阵（示例）：&#10;┌─────────────────┬──────────┬──────────┬──────────┬──────────┐&#10;│ 源 \\ 目标       │ Web 层   │ App 层   │ DB 层    │ 互联网   │&#10;├─────────────────┼──────────┼──────────┼──────────┼──────────┤&#10;│ 互联网          │ ✓ 443    │ ✗        │ ✗        │ -        │&#10;│ Web 层          │ -        │ ✓ 8080   │ ✗        │ ✓ 443    │&#10;│ App 层          │ ✗        │ -        │ ✓ 5432   │ ✓ 443    │&#10;│ DB 层           │ ✗        │ ✗        │ -        │ ✗        │&#10;└─────────────────┴──────────┴──────────┴──────────┴──────────┘\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>连通性矩阵（示例）：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>┌─────────────────┬──────────┬──────────┬──────────┬──────────┐</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│ 源 \\ 目标       │ Web 层   │ App 层   │ DB 层    │ 互联网   │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├─────────────────┼──────────┼──────────┼──────────┼──────────┤</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│ 互联网          │ ✓ 443    │ ✗        │ ✗        │ -        │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│ Web 层          │ -        │ ✓ 8080   │ ✗        │ ✓ 443    │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│ App 层          │ ✗        │ -        │ ✓ 5432   │ ✓ 443    │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│ DB 层           │ ✗        │ ✗        │ -        │ ✗        │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└─────────────────┴──────────┴──────────┴──────────┴──────────┘</span></span></code></pre></div><p>将矩阵转化为自动化测试：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"type ConnectivityTest struct {&#10;    Source      string&#10;    Destination string&#10;    Port        int&#10;    Expected    bool // true=应连通, false=应阻断&#10;}&#10;&#10;var connectivityMatrix = []ConnectivityTest{&#10;    {&quot;web-sg&quot;, &quot;app-sg&quot;, 8080, true},&#10;    {&quot;web-sg&quot;, &quot;db-sg&quot;, 5432, false},&#10;    {&quot;app-sg&quot;, &quot;db-sg&quot;, 5432, true},&#10;    {&quot;internet&quot;, &quot;web-sg&quot;, 443, true},&#10;    {&quot;internet&quot;, &quot;db-sg&quot;, 5432, false},&#10;}&#10;&#10;func TestConnectivityMatrix(t *testing.T) {&#10;    for _, tc := range connectivityMatrix {&#10;        t.Run(fmt.Sprintf(&quot;%s-&gt;%s:%d&quot;, tc.Source, tc.Destination, tc.Port), func(t *testing.T) {&#10;            result := testTCPConnect(tc.Source, tc.Destination, tc.Port)&#10;            assert.Equal(t, tc.Expected, result)&#10;        })&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ConnectivityTest</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Source      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">string</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Destination </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">string</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Port        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Expected    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bool</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> // true=应连通, false=应阻断</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> connectivityMatrix </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ConnectivityTest</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"web-sg\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"app-sg\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8080</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"web-sg\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"db-sg\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5432</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"app-sg\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"db-sg\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5432</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"internet\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"web-sg\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">443</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"internet\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"db-sg\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5432</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TestConnectivityMatrix</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">t</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">testing</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> _, tc </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> connectivityMatrix {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        t.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(fmt.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Sprintf</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">%s</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">%s</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">%d</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, tc.Source, tc.Destination, tc.Port), </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">t</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">testing</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> testTCPConnect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(tc.Source, tc.Destination, tc.Port)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            assert.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Equal</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(t, tc.Expected, result)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"aws-vpc-reachability-analyzer\">AWS VPC Reachability Analyzer</h2><p>AWS 提供 VPC Reachability Analyzer 服务，通过分析网络配置（而非发送实际数据包）来判断两个端点之间是否可达。这是一种<strong>静态网络分析</strong>——不需要运行中的实例：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[创建 Network Insights Path] --&gt; B[Source: ENI/Instance/IGW]&#10;    A --&gt; C[Destination: ENI/Instance/Gateway]&#10;    B --&gt; D[启动分析]&#10;    C --&gt; D&#10;    D --&gt; E{可达?}&#10;    E --&gt;|是| F[返回完整路径]&#10;    E --&gt;|否| G[返回阻断点和原因]\">graph TD\n    A[创建 Network Insights Path] --&gt; B[Source: ENI/Instance/IGW]\n    A --&gt; C[Destination: ENI/Instance/Gateway]\n    B --&gt; D[启动分析]\n    C --&gt; D\n    D --&gt; E{可达?}\n    E --&gt;|是| F[返回完整路径]\n    E --&gt;|否| G[返回阻断点和原因]</pre><p>在 Terraform 中自动化 Reachability Analyzer：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"hcl\" data-code=\"resource &quot;aws_ec2_network_insights_path&quot; &quot;web_to_db&quot; {&#10;  source      = aws_instance.web.id&#10;  destination = aws_instance.db.id&#10;  protocol    = &quot;tcp&quot;&#10;  destination_port = 5432&#10;}&#10;&#10;resource &quot;aws_ec2_network_insights_analysis&quot; &quot;web_to_db&quot; {&#10;  network_insights_path_id = aws_ec2_network_insights_path.web_to_db.id&#10;}&#10;&#10;# 在测试中验证分析结果&#10;output &quot;web_to_db_reachable&quot; {&#10;  value = aws_ec2_network_insights_analysis.web_to_db.status == &quot;succeeded&quot; ? aws_ec2_network_insights_analysis.web_to_db.path_found : false&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>resource \"aws_ec2_network_insights_path\" \"web_to_db\" {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  source      = aws_instance.web.id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  destination = aws_instance.db.id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  protocol    = \"tcp\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  destination_port = 5432</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>resource \"aws_ec2_network_insights_analysis\" \"web_to_db\" {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  network_insights_path_id = aws_ec2_network_insights_path.web_to_db.id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 在测试中验证分析结果</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>output \"web_to_db_reachable\" {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  value = aws_ec2_network_insights_analysis.web_to_db.status == \"succeeded\" ? aws_ec2_network_insights_analysis.web_to_db.path_found : false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"dns-解析验证\">DNS 解析验证</h2><p>DNS 配置错误是网络故障的常见原因之一。测试应覆盖：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>验证场景</th>\n<th>期望结果</th>\n<th>验证命令</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>内部服务发现</td>\n<td><code>app.internal</code> → 私有 IP</td>\n<td><code>dig +short app.internal @vpc-dns</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>外部域名解析</td>\n<td><code>api.example.com</code> → ALB IP</td>\n<td><code>dig +short api.example.com</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨 VPC 解析</td>\n<td>Peered VPC 的 PHZ 记录可解析</td>\n<td><code>dig +short db.peer.internal</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Split-horizon DNS</td>\n<td>内部返回私有 IP，外部返回公网 IP</td>\n<td>从两个位置分别 <code>dig</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"func TestDNSResolution(t *testing.T) {&#10;    // 验证 Private Hosted Zone 记录&#10;    answers := dns.DNSLookup(t, &quot;app.internal&quot;, &quot;A&quot;)&#10;    assert.True(t, isPrivateIP(answers[0]))&#10;&#10;    // 验证跨 VPC DNS 解析（通过 Peering）&#10;    answers = dns.DNSLookup(t, &quot;database.shared.internal&quot;, &quot;A&quot;)&#10;    assert.NotEmpty(t, answers)&#10;    assert.True(t, isInVPCCIDR(answers[0], &quot;10.1.0.0/16&quot;))&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TestDNSResolution</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">t</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">testing</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 验证 Private Hosted Zone 记录</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    answers </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dns.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">DNSLookup</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(t, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"app.internal\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"A\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    assert.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(t, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">isPrivateIP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(answers[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 验证跨 VPC DNS 解析（通过 Peering）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    answers </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dns.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">DNSLookup</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(t, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"database.shared.internal\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"A\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    assert.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">NotEmpty</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(t, answers)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    assert.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(t, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">isInVPCCIDR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(answers[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">], </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"10.1.0.0/16\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"跨区域与跨账户连通性\">跨区域与跨账户连通性</h2><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>c</mi><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>T</mi><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>w</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>L</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>N</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Latency_{cross-region} = RTT_{network} + T_{TLS} + T_{DNS}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">cr</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">oss</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">tw</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>跨区域/跨账户的网络测试需要额外关注：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>VPC Peering</strong>：验证双向路由表配置正确</li>\n<li><strong>Transit Gateway</strong>：验证路由传播和关联</li>\n<li><strong>PrivateLink/VPC Endpoint</strong>：验证服务端点可达且策略正确</li>\n<li><strong>跨账户 RAM 共享</strong>：验证共享子网中的资源互通</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"负面测试-验证隔离\">负面测试：验证隔离</h2><p>网络测试中<strong>负面测试</strong>（验证不应连通的路径确实被阻断）比正面测试更重要——因为安全漏洞通常是意外的连通，而非意外的阻断：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"func TestDBIsolation(t *testing.T) {&#10;    // 验证数据库不可从公网访问&#10;    _, err := net.DialTimeout(&quot;tcp&quot;,&#10;        fmt.Sprintf(&quot;%s:5432&quot;, dbPublicIP),&#10;        5*time.Second)&#10;    assert.Error(t, err) // 期望连接超时&#10;&#10;    // 验证数据库不可从 Web 层直接访问&#10;    output := ssh.CheckSshCommandE(t, webInstanceIP,&#10;        fmt.Sprintf(&quot;nc -zw3 %s 5432&quot;, dbPrivateIP))&#10;    assert.Contains(t, output, &quot;Connection timed out&quot;)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TestDBIsolation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">t</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">testing</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 验证数据库不可从公网访问</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    _, err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> net.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">DialTimeout</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tcp\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        fmt.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Sprintf</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">%s</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">:5432\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, dbPublicIP),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        5</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">time.Second)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    assert.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(t, err) </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 期望连接超时</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 验证数据库不可从 Web 层直接访问</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    output </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ssh.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">CheckSshCommandE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(t, webInstanceIP,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        fmt.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Sprintf</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"nc -zw3 </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">%s</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 5432\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, dbPrivateIP))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    assert.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Contains</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(t, output, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Connection timed out\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"持续连通性监控\">持续连通性监控</h2><p>部署时的网络测试只验证了<em>初始状态</em>的连通性。运行时可能因为安全组变更、路由表修改或 NACL 调整导致连通性退化。持续监控方案：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>合成探针</strong>：从每个网络层定期向其他层发送探测请求</li>\n<li><strong>VPC Flow Logs 分析</strong>：检测意外的 REJECT 记录</li>\n<li><strong>CloudWatch 连通性检查</strong>：监控关键路径的可用性</li>\n</ul>\n<p>关于如何将网络测试整合到 CI/CD 管道中自动化运行，参见 <a href=\"../operations/infra-test-in-pipeline\">CI/CD 中的基础设施测试</a>。关于与网络安全相关的合规扫描方法，参见 <a href=\"security-compliance-scanning\">安全合规扫描</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>网络连通性测试将隐式的&quot;能通/不能通&quot;转化为显式断言。连通性矩阵使网络拓扑的期望行为可编码、可版本化、可自动验证。负面测试（验证隔离）比正面测试（验证连通）更重要，因为安全漏洞通常源于意外的连通。AWS Reachability Analyzer 等静态分析工具可在不创建计算资源的情况下验证网络路径，大幅降低验证成本。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"网络连通性测试","id":"网络连通性测试"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"网络连通性的验证层次","id":"网络连通性的验证层次"},{"level":2,"text":"声明式连通性规约","id":"声明式连通性规约"},{"level":2,"text":"AWS VPC Reachability Analyzer","id":"aws-vpc-reachability-analyzer"},{"level":2,"text":"DNS 解析验证","id":"dns-解析验证"},{"level":2,"text":"跨区域与跨账户连通性","id":"跨区域与跨账户连通性"},{"level":2,"text":"负面测试：验证隔离","id":"负面测试-验证隔离"},{"level":2,"text":"持续连通性监控","id":"持续连通性监控"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"基础设施集成测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/infrastructure-testing/integration-e2e/infrastructure-integration-tests"},"next":{"title":"安全合规扫描","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/infrastructure-testing/integration-e2e/security-compliance-scanning"}}